  "song": "pdva-p02",
  "verse": 10,
  "quick_english": "Whatever lights there are, in me, in the highest sky having found room — they shine in me, in eternal glory, undistinguished. I am He — unfeigned, eternal, of unbroken measure, infinite, true, free, dispelling the darkness of the foe-pair, nondual and not, with beginningless waking-light.",
